# block-string-gen-folded-strip-extra-indent-dedent

## Input

```
key >-
  a
    b
  c
end marker

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..32
  ENTRY@0..21
    WORD_KEY@0..3
      WORD@0..3 "key"
    SPACE@3..4 " "
    BLOCK_STRING@4..21
      BLOCK_STRING_HEADER@4..7
        GT@4..5 ">"
        MINUS@5..6 "-"
        NEWLINE@6..7 "\n"
      SPACE@7..9 "  "
      LINE_STRING@9..10
        STRING@9..10 "a"
      NEWLINE@10..11 "\n"
      SPACE@11..13 "  "
      LINE_STRING@13..16
        STRING@13..16 "  b"
      NEWLINE@16..17 "\n"
      SPACE@17..19 "  "
      LINE_STRING@19..20
        STRING@19..20 "c"
      NEWLINE@20..21 "\n"
  ENTRY@21..32
    WORD_KEY@21..24
      WORD@21..24 "end"
    SPACE@24..25 " "
    LINE_STRING@25..31
      STRING@25..31 "marker"
    NEWLINE@31..32 "\n"
```

